BACKUP ~weidu_external/zddm/backup~
SUPPORT "https://github.com/dark0dave/drunkenmaster/issues"
VERSION @4 /* v0.1.0 */
README ~zddm/readme.md~
ASK_EVERY_COMPONENT
// MODDER
// setup_tra warn
// area_variables warn
// missing_extern warn
// missing_resref warn
// ict2_actions warn
// missing_eval warn
// overwriting_file warn
